The kind Norwegian There is a cross-country skiing race which is part of the Winter Olympics.

5
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:22,520
In 2006 a Canadian skier, Sara Renner,

6
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:26,980
was taking part in the cross-country final when her left pole broke.

7
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:34,640
This was a serious problem as she needed the pole to help her travel quickly through the deep snow.

8
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:44,920
So Renner was able to get a silver medal.

