00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:08,460
The Special Olympic athlete For athlete Eric Williams gold medals are nice,

10
00:01:08,620 --> 00:01:11,420
but good sportsmanship is more important.

11
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:24,940
In 2005 Eric competed in running races and the long jump.

12
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:31,480
He said, "I’ve been competing in the Special Olympics ever since I was at high school.

13
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,560
It’s really a good experience.

14
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:38,840
You get to meet different athletes and volunteers and make all kinds of friends."

15
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,340
John Corbett,

16
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:44,480
an organizer of the Special Olympics said, "

17
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:49,000
He always does his best and has a wonderful time in the process.

18
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:53,480
He truly appreciates (感激) all the people around him who are trying to help,

19
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:55,860
